---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Privacy Policy | XFour"
	description="How XFour IT Limited handles personal data collected through xfour.co.uk."
	liveChat={false}
>
<section class="clean-block clean-info dark">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="d-xl-flex flex-column justify-content-xl-center align-items-xl-center block-heading" style="width: 90vw;">
            <h1 class="text-info">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p style="margin: 0;width: 90%;min-width: 90%;">At XFour we believe in a simple privacy policy. <br><br>We will not share your data without your express permission. <br><br>This website runs a Microsoft Dynamics 365 Omnichannel live chat. If you start a chat, Microsoft sets cookies in your browser on our behalf and the conversation, together with any details you give us in it, is stored in our Dynamics 365 system so that we can answer you. <br><br>We do not run any website analytics at the time of writing. If we add analytics we will update this policy first and ask for your consent. <br><br>When you sign up to an agreement with XFour, you will be provided with a data protection addendum which will contain full details of what data will be kept, for how long and for what purposes.&nbsp;<br><br>The data controller is XFour IT Limited, company number 11776254.<br>Registered office address: 100 Berkshire Place, C/O KT Wells Ltd, Winnersh Triangle, Wokingham, RG41 5RD.<br>For data and privacy enquiries, please email gdpr@xfour.co.uk. <br><br>Last updated 7 October 2026.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
